Z||000007||WaltR||04-09-2001||08:15 PM||||I have 17x8 Konig Vilians With A520s.<BR>215/45s front 235/45s rear. Suspension has<BR>been lowered 1.5 inches all around and they clear fine. The 235s are a little larger dia. My spedo is just under 6% off now.<BR>235s need at least a7.5 inch wheel. I would not put them on a 7 incher because of the short sidewall. I bought the 8 inch wheels so if I go to a SC3800 later I can increase the tire size on both ends.||||reg||1
